{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning everyone. I'd like to get our weekly sustainment review started. We've got used oil drums, vehicle batteries, expired medical cold packs, and empty compressed-air cylinders in the holding area awaiting disposition. Before I sign off on the disposition plan, I need each of you to report your confirmed updates: environmental on any handling controls or requirements, maintenance on the oil drums and batteries, medical-logistics on the expired cold packs, and transportation on scheduled pickup or transfer for each category. Please go ahead with your updates."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Good morning. For the environmental update, I confirmed this morning that the used oil consists of exactly 18 drums accepted by the contracted recycling service, with pickup available on 26 June. The contractor confirmation is in the environmental file, but it has not yet been added to the S-4 disposition worksheet."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "For the transportation update on the empty compressed-air cylinders: I've confirmed that the carrier will accept them only on 28 June, and they must be secured upright in a cylinder rack during loading. The carrier's acceptance note was received after the last transportation update and has not yet been added to the movement worksheet."}
```

