{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF3", "text": "Good morning, Major Lawson. For the medical-logistics update on the expired medical cold packs: I confirmed that the expired medical cold packs must be returned to Medical Supply rather than discarded locally. The return appointment is set for 25 June. The appointment is on the clinic supply calendar, but I should note it has not yet been cross-referenced with the holding-area disposition plan."}
```

